 Step : +4% evasion per level (up to +8% evasion)", "html": "<ul> <li><a href=\"/en/w/overrank/passives/lethality\">Lethality</a>: +6% critical damage per level (up to +30% critical damage)</li> <li><a href=\"/en/w/overrank/passives/agile-blade\">Agile Blade</a>: +3% attack speed, +6% max mana, +4% mana regeneration per level (up to +15% attack speed, +30% max mana, +20% mana regeneration)</li> <li><a href=\"/en/w/overrank/passives/vital-points\">Vital Points</a>: +3% critical chance per level (up to +9% critical chance)</li> <li><a href=\"/en/w/overrank/passives/ghost-step\">Ghost Step</a>: +4% evasion per level (up to +8% evasion)</li> </ul>"}]}, {"id": "how-to-unlock", "heading": "How to unlock", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "Pick it freely in the class window (status window, then Change class ).", "html": "<p>Pick it freely in the class window (status window, then <strong>Change class</strong>).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Changing class: the first change of a profile is free, then it costs 100 shards × your level (at least 1,000). There is a 60 s delay between two changes, your level is kept by steps of 50 (level 449 becomes 400), and your stat points and skill trees are given back. See Economy formulas .", "html": "<p>Changing class: the first change of a profile is free, then it costs <strong>100 shards × your level</strong> (at least 1,000). There is a 60 s delay between two changes, your level is kept by steps of 50 (level 449 becomes 400), and your stat points and skill trees are given back. See <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/formulas/economy\">Economy formulas</a>.</p>"}]}], "media": [{"src": "/api/media/wiki/2026/10/model-classes-assassin.glb", "alt": "Assassin: interactive 3D view", "kind": "3d-model"}], "related": [{"text": "Reaper", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/reaper", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/reaper.webp"}, {"text": "Overlord", "href": "/en/w/overrank/classes/overlord", "img": "/games/overrank/classes/overlord.webp"}, {"text": "Warper", "h